[36m(TaskRunner pid=493843)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=493843)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=493843)[0m We need to find the divisors of \(9!\) that end in 1. These divisors must be congruent to 1 modulo 10. This means the units digit is 1, which is an odd number.
